{"id":90148635862803,"name":"🧟 Survive the Apocalypse","desc":"The Apocalypse has begun, and you've been left behind...\n\nHow to Play: \n🔍 Loot the City\n🛡️ Build Defenses\n🧟 Survive the Zombies\n🏃‍♂️ Will you Escape?\n\nEnjoy the game? Remember to like (👍) and favourite (🌟)!","path":"/game/90148635862803-survive-the-apocalypse","slug":"90148635862803-survive-the-apocalypse","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/423d487da5fca23ba5d0ba220870751ba02227223d13a5fdb94530290159f514.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-066f72820a4ee6a2488f35e9b899ec02/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7714,"visitor":276203967,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-23T21:14:12.883Z","creator":{"name":"Rubicon South","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":22,"freeCount":21,"keyCount":6,"verifiedCount":1},"page":2,"next":null,"total":2,"totalPages":2,"scripts":[{"_id":"69bb055c67b3dcfd36fb703d","title":"SPYMM STA v8.3 [UPD] - BEST KEYLESS/OPEN SOURCE","game":{"_id":"69ac4599ec95ce09d1242847","gameId":90148635862803,"name":"🧟 Survive the Apocalypse","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/423d487da5fca23ba5d0ba220870751ba02227223d13a5fdb94530290159f514.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-066f72820a4ee6a2488f35e9b899ec02/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"90148635862803-survive-the-apocalypse","path":"/game/90148635862803-survive-the-apocalypse","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/423d487da5fca23ba5d0ba220870751ba02227223d13a5fdb94530290159f514.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-066f72820a4ee6a2488f35e9b899ec02/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":90148635862803},"slug":"Survive-the-Apocalypse-SPYMM-for-STA-134563","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":37207,"executes":7307,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d3313d7ad533db4a7cc386f4b745661c292a67fd0b1d558dca7d7387b11e518e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/90148635862803-1775313943720.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/90148635862803-1775313943720.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d3313d7ad533db4a7cc386f4b745661c292a67fd0b1d558dca7d7387b11e518e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/90148635862803-1775313943720.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/90148635862803-1775313943720.jpg"},"likeCount":8,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2026-03-18T20:04:44.755Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-18T20:04:44.755Z","lastBump":"2026-03-18T20:04:44.755Z","script":"-- SPYMM v8.3\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HxnryLSD/SPYMM-rblx/refs/heads/main/SPYMM-STA-Latest.lua\"))()","features":"SPYMM v8.2 — Features\nGame: Survive the Apocalypse | Menu: Right Shift\n\nSome Features are not listed, im just lazy.\nYou will love it.\n\nVisuals\n- Mob ESP — Highlight + name/distance on all zombies (Runner, Brute, Boss, etc.)\n- Player ESP — Highlight + name/health/distance + equipped tool on all players\n- Structure ESP — Highlight + name/distance on all 18 placed structures\n- Item ESP — 8 categories: Guns (red), Melee (orange), Medical (green), Armor (blue), Food (lime), Resources (cyan), Fuel (gold), Abilities (purple)\n- Chams — See-through highlights for all ESP types\n- Max Distance Slider — Global render cutoff for all ESPs\n\nPlayer\n- Inf Jump — Jump anywhere, even mid-air\n- NoClip — Walk through walls, FE bypassed with anti-rubberband\n- Auto Sprint — Holds sprint key permanently\n- Bunny Hop — Auto-jumps while moving for momentum\n- Funny Dance — Looping dance visible to all players (FE compatible, physics fallback if blocked)\n\nCombat\n- Kill Aura — AoE auto-attack on all mobs in range; configurable range, swing rate, priority, auto-equip, visual target indicator\n- Aimbot — Camera-based aim at mobs/players; configurable FOV, range, smoothness, velocity prediction, aim part, FOV circle\n\nExploits\n- Auto Pickup — Automatically collects nearby items (80+ items, configurable radius + whitelist)\n\nMisc\n- Anti-AFK — Prevents AFK kick (on by default)\n- Fullbright — Removes darkness, restores on disable\n- Remove Fog — Removes all fog, FE bypassed (server can't restore it while active)\n- Server Hop — Joins a random different server\n- Rejoin — Reconnects to the same server instance\n- Remote Spy — Logs all RemoteEvent/RemoteFunction calls to console\n- FPS Unlocker — Sets a custom FPS cap (30–360)\n\nUI Settings\n- Theme Manager, Save Manager (named configs + autoload)\n- DPI scale, corner radius, notification side, custom cursor, rebindable menu key\n\nI will never use any type of key system. Only free or paid.","tags":["Survive the Apocalypse","ESP","Visuals","Keyless"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b","username":"SpyDot","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/79dbe54cec4d324121c6ce158e9d69ebd635e559b0a732587a880a0f2e4e38fd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b-1773861302064.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/79dbe54cec4d324121c6ce158e9d69ebd635e559b0a732587a880a0f2e4e38fd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b-1773861302064.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:30:29.315Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69bb055c67b3dcfd36fb7040","editBy":{"_id":"6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b","username":"SpyDot","status":"offline","id":"6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-18T20:04:44.758Z"},{"_id":"69cbcde518958e9450ba3fee","editBy":{"_id":"6894c7f74ca0926b17c9270b","username":"SpyDot","status":"offline","id":"6894c7